            <note corresp="#d88-f1" n="1" xml:id="d88-f1-content">
                <p>The file translation here printed is one prepared at the Peace Conference, with
                    some minor corrections. The German text contained in the White Book published by
                    the German Foreign Office, June 1919, <ref target="#pg35">pp. 35</ref> ff., is
                    filed under Paris Peace Conf. 185.118/84.</p>
            </note>
